  steps:
    1. Pick height H in 3-6, panel_width W in 5-9
    2. Pick two distinct non-BLACK colors for left and right panels
    3. For each panel, randomly set ~40-50% of cells to the panel's foreground color
    4. Verify both-empty count (grey cells) is >= 3 to ensure non-trivial output
    5. Concatenate left and right panels horizontally to form input grid
    6. Output = GREY where both panels are BLACK, else BLACK
```
